	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">De historia episcopi <placeName ref="l1944">Valentiae</placeName> interea nihil amplius audivi; <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sed is, qui mihi primo retulit, vir gravis, doctus et fide dignus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>est.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Rumorem de mortua <persName ref="p18554">Maria Anglię</persName> confirmarunt <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><persName ref="p8417">Musculo</persName> capitanei quidam Valesiani <placeName ref="l760">Solodoro</placeName> venientes, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quos ipse apud <placeName>Frauwenbrunnen</placeName> in hospitio offendit, cum hisce <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>diebus ad <persName ref="p8012">Hallerum</persName> quaestorem proficisceretur in pagum, ubi se curari <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>sinit, atque hoc amplius addiderunt illi <persName ref="p18465">Elizabetham</persName> iam <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>regno inauguratam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l473">Sangallenses</placeName> etiam quidam e <placeName ref="l301">Lugdun<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>o</placeName> veniens mihi retulit vicarium <placeName ref="l301">Lugdunensem</placeName> ex aula <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>regis ad suos hoc scripsisse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Unum hoc mirantur nostri regem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>aut legatum eius <placeName ref="l760">Solodorensem</placeName> nihil ea de re scribere, cum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>alias, quicquid habeat plausibile, statim nostris significet.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Audiemus ergo brevi confirmatiora.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quod literas tuas <persName ref="p8055">Blaurero</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>missas concernit, nihil audio amplius; scio tamen illum quaedam <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nostratibus quibusdam retulisse parum circumspecte.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Diser nacht <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>kumpt ein bott von <placeName ref="l167">Genff</placeName>, bringt böse mär, das die un<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ruͦw zuͦ <placeName ref="l167">Genff</placeName> sich wyter erhept; dann uff den 16. <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>meyens <foreign xml:lang="la">(ut puto me proxime scripsisse)</foreign> sind ettlich ufrürer <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>eim ehrenman uff der nacht ins hus brochen, in zigen, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>er enthalte darinn ettlich ufrürig <placeName ref="l832">Frantzosen</placeName>; die welle<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nd si suͦchen.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Aber habend nieman funden, und ist die <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>sach ylends gstillet, doch ettlich der ufruͤreren inglegt.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Darzwüschend, als si angfangen den coniuratis eigenlich <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>nachfragen und der ursach ir ufruͦr, ist houptman <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><placeName>Perrin</placeName>, ein gwaltiger zuͦ <placeName ref="l167">Genff</placeName>, mitt ettlichen burgeren <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>in eim schiff uff dem <placeName>Roddan</placeName> entwichen, deß sich <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>die sach noch meer geböseret.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Was wyter verhanden, weiß <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>ich nitt.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Min her stattschryber <persName>Äscher</persName>, so jetz vor räth <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>und burgeren ist, wil ich dises schryb, wirt vilicht mee dar<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>von vernemmen und üch zwüßen thuͦn, dann ich wüste.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Interea unus ministrorum <placeName ref="l167">Genevensium</placeName> hic agit <persName ref="p540">Calvini</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>eiusque doctrinae gratia, et accersiti sunt denuo aliqui mi<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>nistri agri nostri, agitaturque causa haec cum maximo offen<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>diculo et exacerbatione omnium nostrorum, et nisi dominus singulari <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>gratia nobis consensum dedisset in hoc negotio, omnino <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>actum esset de ecclesia hac.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Accedit et aliud, quod me <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>nunc torquet.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quidam circulator <persName>Pythonicus</persName> praestigiator <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>hic captus nunc dimissus est, et, ut incredulitas passim <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>obtinet, plurimi sunt, qui illum fovent.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Sed dabit dominus, ut <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>sentiant mox se delusos suo magno malo.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Promittit <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>ille thermas calidas se inventurum non procul ab urbe nostra <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>et multa alia agit empyricam profitendo tegitque nequitiam <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>omnem evangelii praetextu et tantumnon, ut concionandi <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>illi potestas detur, contendit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Confundat illum dominus et omnes, qui <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>his vanitatibus nituntur.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Opponemus nos tantisper, donec explodatu<lb xml:id="p1z46"/>r aut dominus illum confundat.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Haec modo habui.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z47"/>Vale cum familia omni.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Mei te tuosque omnes salutant; <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>salvi sint <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherus</persName> et generi omnes.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> ultima maii 1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">H[a<lb xml:id="p1z49"/>ller<lb xml:id="p1z50"/>us]</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae pastori fidelissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et compatri suo honorando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
